!docs/thesis/thesis-tex-estonian/figures/**

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*/.ipynb_checkpoints/*

# Unsorted presentation/brand exports. Promote curated thesis-facing artifacts
# to docs/research/artifacts/ with a README instead of relying on broad globs.
docs/notebooklm-pack/*.pdf
docs/stitch-taltech-pack/*.png
docs/thesis/presentation/*.pdf
docs/thesis/presentation/*.html
docs/thesis/thesis-typst-estonian/figures/penguins/
wake-word/figures/

# Keep example/template files
!*example*
!*template*
!README*.md
!*/README*.md
